 "_correction": "doc36 records the battle pools as [0x5411f] and [0x54117]. Neither address occurs as a `push dword [..]` operand anywhere in this EXE (0 sites). The pools actually used are listed below; 0x54153 and 0x5414b are the plausible current-EXE counterparts. This is the same stale-address class of error already found for the revival cost table (0x52669) and the sfx 0xb call site (0x2cac3).",
